Yes.

00:20:20.180 --> 00:20:24.650
Hey, why are we hiding?

00:20:25.560 --> 00:20:27.140
It's to prepare our hearts.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:29.260
That's amazing.

00:20:31.530 --> 00:20:35.360
Are you okay?

00:20:35.720 --> 00:20:37.750
Ah, thank you very much.

00:20:39.450 --> 00:20:39.970
Hey!

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:44.470
I heard that you and Chiharu are having a fight again?

00:20:44.950 --> 00:20:47.020
Yeah, I'll let you go alone.

00:20:47.260 --> 00:20:48.450
There are a lot of women like that.

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:49.950
Hey!

00:20:51.320 --> 00:20:53.930
Hmm? Do you want to go out with me?

00:20:55.110 --> 00:20:57.840
I won't forgive you!

00:20:58.020 --> 00:20:58.510
This is what I want!

00:21:00.410 --> 00:21:11.790
I'll take good care of you when you get older, brother.

00:21:12.070 --> 00:21:14.800
Come here.

00:21:15.260 --> 00:21:16.960
Hey, master!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:17.670
You're good!

00:21:20.250 --> 00:21:20.610
Yeah.

00:21:27.710 --> 00:21:29.380
Leader, are you done with work?

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:38.200
I'm a little late, but I'm going to announce my goal this week.

00:21:39.300 --> 00:21:43.530
It's important to take care of the elderly.

00:21:45.360 --> 00:21:52.680
I think it's the most important thing.

00:21:53.240 --> 00:21:54.060
That's right.

00:21:54.900 --> 00:21:55.440
Don't call me little brother.

00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:06.130
I don't know if it's okay to quit, but I feel like I'm back to being the former leader again.

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:10.070
I wonder if the Benisatori team will be opposed to this for a while.

00:22:10.850 --> 00:22:13.530
This Gagi! This time and this time!
